  "body": "MODERN SINGLE-LEVEL & MOVE IN READY!\r\n\r\nRight in the heart of Mairangi Bay, this beautifully presented home delivers easy-care coastal living just moments from the beach and village.\r\n\r\nGrab your morning coffee, stroll to the beach or enjoy dinner at one of the local cafés and restaurants - everything you need is right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nInside, the home is warm, light-filled and effortlessly functional, with open-plan living and dining. Two generous double bedrooms, a spacious kitchen and separate laundry complete the picture.\r\n\r\nPerfect for downsizer's, professionals, investors or anyone wanting a lock-up-and-leave by the coast, this is an opportunity to secure a low-maintenance home in one of the North Shore's most sought-after seaside suburbs.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n- Prime Mairangi Bay location, moments from the beach and village.\r\n- Light-filled open-plan living and dining.\r\n- Two generous double bedrooms.\r\n- Separate laundry.\r\n- Easy-care, lock-up-and-leave living.\r\n- Walk to cafés, restaurants, shops and Mairangi Bay Beach.\r\n- Zoned for Murrays Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Rangitoto College.\r\n\r\nAuction (unless sold prior) - Thursday 29 October 2026.",
